  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNRISD (United Nations Research Institute for Social Development) &#xe4;r  en forskningsinstitution som bedriver forskning i centrala sociala,   ekonommiska, och politiska fr&#xe5;gor relevanta f&#xf6;r FNs arbete.                                                                                  UNRISD arbetar med globala forskningsn&#xe4;tverk och f&#xf6;rser regeringar,  bist&#xe5;ndsorg., NGO:s, och akademiker med forskresultat/policy brief</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRISD is a research organisation established by the UN. It conducts  research on central social, economic and political issues relevant    for the UN.                                                            UNRISD works through extensive international research networks and   provides governments, development agencies, grassroot org., and       scholars with research results and policy briefs on above areas.</narrative>
  </description>
